{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bzBOkjCuXM1795323861.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港大部分地區中午氣溫約19至22度，本周中期會再度轉涼。</p><p></p><p>天文台指，一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流今明兩日影響華南沿岸，雲量增多，氣溫略為回升。今日預測大致多雲，今晚有一兩陣微雨。</p><p></p><p>天文台預料東北季候風星期二抵達華南沿岸，天氣轉涼及有雨。隨後一兩日早晚清涼，市區最低降至16度左右，新界再低兩三度。隨著東北季候風本周後期稍為緩和，廣東沿岸天色好轉，氣溫回升，但日夜溫差頗大。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:03:43.427175+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:19.897627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:57:12.674439+00:00","content_hash":"7c9db349cc9e4480106a709d8bb5bc79f73fe3ecdecab147a00a28c69c7e5748","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:03:43.427175+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}